  "details": "When using the Pico Standalone version, Personal Mirror will break when you disable the Headset Tracking through system settings.\n\nReproduction steps:\n\n1. Start VRChat\n\n2. Enable Personal Mirror through Expression Menu\n\n3. Disable Headset tracking in PicoOS settings (Settings -> General -> Headset Tracking)\n\n4. Observe the mirror breaking",
